cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the RegulonDB documentation, please cite it as below.
  To cite RegulonDB data, cite the reference publication listed under references.
title: RegulonDB Documentation
abstract: >-
  Documentation of RegulonDB, the database on transcriptional regulation in
  Escherichia coli K-12: policies, search and browse, data access, glossary,
  evidence classification, releases, and technical reference.
authors:
  - name: RegulonDB Team
    address: Centro de Ciencias Genómicas, Universidad Nacional Autónoma de México
    city: Cuernavaca
